      ],
      "text": "3.1.1\t Background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.416748046875,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Among people newly diagnosed with TB globally in 2022, 80% had a documented HIV test result",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4468383789062,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": ". At the regional level, the highest percentages were achieved in the WHO African and European  (1)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.4305419921875,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "regions, at 89% and 93%, respectively, in 2022  . Globally 7.3% of people with a new episode of TB  (1)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.4464721679688,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "who had an HIV test result were living with HIV. HIV testing for people with diagnosed or presumptive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4531860351562,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "TB offers a strategic entry point to a continuum of prevention, care, support and treatment of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.3858642578125,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "HIV and for TB. Offering HIV testing services along with TB contact tracing among close or family",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.3836669921875,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "contacts of people with TB can help in the targeted scale-up of HIV testing, and in TB prevention due",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.4246215820312,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "to early identification of those who do not know their HIV status, early initiation of ART and treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        339.29034423828125,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "of TB disease or TB infection when TB disease is ruled out.",
